","The signaling pathway of the newly discovered cytokine likely involves the PI3K/Akt pathway. This conclusion is based on the observation that signal-induced transcription is blocked by the presence of wortmannin, Ly294002, and BX795. These are all inhibitors of the PI3K/Akt pathway:

