In conclusion, while MCTs may have some potential for weight loss, further research is needed to determine their optimal dosage and effectiveness in obese individuals on a calorie-restricted diet. It is essential to consult with a healthcare professional before incorporating MCTs into your diet, especially if you have any health restrictions or conditions.

